      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRAVE CALL (4) got off the mark with his maiden victory last time at this track over 350m (20.60). Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Expected to go well again. NANGAR COUNTY (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Fascinate Mark (20.60) in a Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Has good speed and is aided by the cherry draw. Can feature again. BIG WEST (2) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at Casino over 411m behind Pass The Peppa (24.53) in a Grade 5. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Should be thereabouts. EDITH ACES (3) should be thereabouts.",
